       "oob"
      ]
     },
     "subject": "terminal:sudo"
    }
   ],
   "$comment": "the vendor OWN human gate observed READ-ONLY, with the vendor decision menu carried as DATA: options ride the vendor's return contract (once/session/always/deny — the choice set post_approval_response can deliver; static labels = the vendor's own menu wording, structural at metadata like the prompt rule; the menu's Show-full-command entry is an information action that never returns a choice — it dissolves, the command already rides the prompt at redacted+). respond_via [oob] declares the honest channel: this request is answered in the agent's own UI, never from the bus; prompt synthesized from structure at metadata, the command text at redacted+ (this pin is at the default attention ceiling: redacted)"
  },
